{"4101750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PHOBOS", "steam_appid": 4101750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5007560], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A 4-8 player social deduction horror game. Solve tasks that need real teamwork, survive monsters that each hunt differently, and figure out who you can trust before they decide for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101750/extras/66ea53f13419c539061fd74dd307c069.avif?t=1788214992\" width=1402 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101750/extras/67ba31e148b5e8b20504fc96b5b5bfed.poster.avif?t=1788214992\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101750/extras/67ba31e148b5e8b20504fc96b5b5bfed.webm?t=1788214992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101750/extras/67ba31e148b5e8b20504fc96b5b5bfed.mp4?t=1788214992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full friend group or public lobby, doesn't matter; the chaos is the same either way</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scream with each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scream at each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screw around with silly items and difficult co-op tasks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101750/extras/84e559f64e8bd7fb65ae6bad61ead5ab.avif?t=1788214992\" width=1402 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" s